<!-- subject -->
邀请加入租户
<!-- variables -->
[{"name":"username","label":"用户名","example":"张三"},{"name":"companyName","label":"公司名","example":"LeapIn"},{"name":"tenantName","label":"租户名","example":"默认租户"},{"name":"inviteUrl","label":"邀请链接","example":"https://example.com/join-tenant?token=xxx"}]
<!-- html -->
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>邀请加入租户</title>
    <style>
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .header {
            background: #2A5CAA;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 25px;
            background: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>邀请加入租户</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>尊敬的{{ username }}，您好！</p>
        <p>【{% if companyName %}{{ companyName }}{% else %}{{ tenantName }}{% endif %}】邀请您加入租户，请点击下面链接完成加入：</p>
        <div class="link">
            <a href="{{ inviteUrl }}" target="_blank" style="color: #2A5CAA; text-decoration: underline;">点击加入租户</a>
        </div>
        <p>如果无法点击链接，请将以下地址复制到浏览器打开：</p>
        <div class="link" style="color: #2A5CAA; text-decoration: underline;">{{ inviteUrl }}</div>
        <p>如果已有系统账号，请登录后完成租户认证；如果没有系统账号，请先注册系统账号后完成租户认证。</p>
        <p>邀请链接 7 天内有效。如有任何问题，请联系管理员。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2025 LeapIn. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
